# Generated artifacts

## UIO Definition

### reserved-memory

```dts
reserved-memory {
    #address-cells = <2>;
    #size-cells = <2>;
    ranges;

    dbg_shm: dbg-shm@88300000 {
        reg = <0x0 0x88300000 0x0 0x2000>;
        no-map;
    };

    ipc_shm_0: ipc-shm@88304000 {
        reg = <0x0 0x88304000 0x0 0x4000>;
        no-map;
    };

    ipc_shm_1: ipc-shm@88308000 {
        reg = <0x0 0x88308000 0x0 0x4000>;
        dma-coherent;
        no-map;
    };
};
```

### mu7

```dts
mu7@42430000 {
    compatible = "generic-uio";
    linux,uio-name = "mu7";
    reg = <0x0 0x42430000 0x0 0x10000>;
    interrupt-parent = <&gic>;
    interrupts = <GIC_SPI 234 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
    status = "okay";
};
```

