### ipc-shm

```dts
ipc-shm@88304000 {
    compatible = "generic-uio";
    linux,uio-name = "ipc-shm";
    reg = <0x0 0x88304000 0x0 0x4000 0x0 0x88308000 0x0 0x4000>;
    memory-region = <&ipc_shm_0 &ipc_shm_1>;
